        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 2
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### SINAL TECNICO (runtime `quantum-assistant`)\nTodas as requisicoes atendidas: disponibilidade, erro e latencia. **Verde aqui nao prova resposta correta.**"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 2
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### SINAL DE QUALIDADE (probes rotulados, *proxy sintetico*)\nPerguntas com resposta conhecida enviadas pelo simulador. Nao e trafego humano."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requisicoes por segundo (por rota)",
      "description": "rate(requests_total) do runtime local, janela 1m.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(requests_total{job=\"quantum-assistant\", release_id=~\"$release\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
